I built the sprint board in `src/` (`model.ts`, `message.ts`, `command.ts`, `board.ts`, `update.ts`, `view.ts`, and `main.ts`, which exports `Model`, `init`, `update` and `view`). `./check` passes and all 26 visible tests pass. I was unsure about several choices the brief leaves open: adding a card or checklist item is a no-op until its column or checklist has loaded, move buttons are hidden into columns that have not loaded, and a rollback returns a card to its original index, which may be off if two moves overlap. Responses from an earlier page visit are ignored through a session counter. The visible run logged one 404 that I did not investigate, probably a missing favicon.